    "intro_narrative": "The air in Detective Marlowe’s study is thick with the scent of old parchment and cold tobacco. He vanished three days ago, leaving behind a trail of cryptic leads that point to this very room. The walls are lined with bookshelves, but it’s the strange mechanical devices humming in the shadows that catch your eye. At the center of it all is a massive steel vault—the Master Safe—which Marlowe claimed held the only evidence capable of bringing down the city's most powerful crime syndicate. You must navigate a web of encrypted data and hidden compartments to unlock the secrets he left behind before the syndicate's cleaners arrive to wipe the scene clean.",
    "narrative_style": "mystery"
